<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Slow Rot</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 34)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast slow rot &lt;corpse&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster treats a corpse with their own blood while chanting, and a 
black aura envelops it. The corpse then rots at its own slow pace: it 
smells for about eight minutes before the maggots consume it, a little 
longer than a monster's corpse would otherwise last, giving you time to 
raise it or search it. A corpse can be treated only once.
</p><p>Don't cast it on a player's corpse: theirs normally lasts much longer, 
and the spell would make it rot away in eight minutes, with everything 
on it.
</p><p>You must be standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
